    <string name="pen_desc_pen">A plain, dependable line; the pen for everyday writing.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_wet">Lands wet and dries in a few seconds; presses darker.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_wave">Waves roll inside the line and leave foam at its shores.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_highlighter">Goes over the writing; everything under it stays readable.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_pencil">Graphite grain; tilt it for a wide, soft shade, press for a darker line.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_calligraphy">A broad nib, thin or thick with its direction, for lettering.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_watercolor">Watery and translucent; the colour deepens where it overlaps.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_neon">Glows like a lit tube in the dark.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_rainbow">Its colour cycles along the line like a rainbow.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_glitter">Ink sprinkled with glitter; it sparkles in the light.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_grass">Grass grows from the line, and flowers open when the pen lifts.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_sea">A sea wave: a foamy shore and turquoise shallows.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_lava">Lava flows and glows first, then crusts over; the embers in its cracks keep burning.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_fountain">The nib opens as you press and the line thickens; the ink stays raised and glossy.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_gold">Liquid gold; it sits raised and catches the light.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_chrome">Mirror chrome; it reflects what is around it.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_ice">An ice crystal: clear, cold, brittle at the edges.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_jelly">Translucent like jelly, glossy and plump.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_galaxy">A starry sky flows along the line.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_lightning">A white core with a halo that flickers like electricity.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_pearl">Pearls strung along the line.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_impasto">Thick oil paint; the brush marks and the relief stay.</string>
    <string name="pen_desc_bloom">A glossy water line; glass flowers open when the pen lifts.</string>

